1
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeniang is such a pain,</font></font>

2
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">making me fetch water for her.</font></font>

3
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hang in there, Duyao.</font></font>

4
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Lordship and the others are out?</font></font>

5
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:53,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪</font></font>

6
00:00:55,580 --> 00:01:01,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪</font></font>

7
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Desire blinds my eyes♪</font></font>

8
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:18,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪</font></font>

9
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪</font></font>

10
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪</font></font>

11
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪</font></font>

12
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪</font></font>

13
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blossom in Darkness]</font></font>

14
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:57,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]</font></font>

15
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 13]</font></font>

16
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Hua Changpu broke the sect's rules,</font></font>

17
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why not just</font></font>

18
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">expel her?</font></font>

19
00:02:10,390 --> 00:02:11,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why kill her so brutally?</font></font>

20
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What Yan Shang did</font></font>

21
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was clearly to settle a personal grudge.</font></font>

22
00:02:16,670 --> 00:02:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Yan Shang was the one who killed</font></font>

23
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hua Changpu,</font></font>

24
00:02:19,670 --> 00:02:21,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why did she take revenge on Du Zhong?</font></font>

25
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because</font></font>

26
00:02:25,270 --> 00:02:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Du Zhong made</font></font>

27
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:28,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">her secret feelings public,</font></font>

28
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">leaving her</font></font>

29
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:32,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with a ruined reputation</font></font>

30
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and getting her killed.</font></font>

31
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yan Shang</font></font>

32
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was truly despicable.</font></font>

33
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good thing he got what he deserved.</font></font>

34
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What was he even trying to achieve?</font></font>

35
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I... I'm sorry.</font></font>

36
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could a single curse from Hua Changpu</font></font>

37
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">really keep Du Zhong's wound</font></font>

38
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from ever healing?</font></font>

39
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course not.</font></font>

40
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His inner demons must have taken root</font></font>

41
00:03:03,430 --> 00:03:04,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because of her words,</font></font>

42
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">weakening his faith in the immortal path</font></font>

43
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:08,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and keeping him from ascending.</font></font>

44
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why</font></font>

45
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:11,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he keeps forcing</font></font>

46
00:03:12,310 --> 00:03:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">those memories</font></font>

47
00:03:13,470 --> 00:03:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">out of his body.</font></font>

48
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The fragment you brought back</font></font>

49
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has turned into a petal too,</font></font>

50
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">now that we're out of the dream.</font></font>

51
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can alter it slightly</font></font>

52
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:23,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and create a false dream</font></font>

53
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to make Du Zhong believe</font></font>

54
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hua Changpu never gravely wounded him.</font></font>

55
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:29,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That will break his obsession.</font></font>

56
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go to him now.</font></font>

57
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No. Not now.</font></font>

58
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right now,</font></font>

59
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he and the other sect leaders</font></font>

60
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are repairing the talisman.</font></font>

61
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There'll still be time to reclaim</font></font>

62
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:43,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your malice after it's been repaired.</font></font>

63
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then it'll be too late.</font></font>

64
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once he ascends to immortality,</font></font>

65
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll leave the mortal world.</font></font>

66
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where would I find him then?</font></font>

67
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll help you find him.</font></font>

68
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You?</font></font>

69
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What makes you so sure you can find him?</font></font>

70
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:58,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides,</font></font>

71
00:03:58,430 --> 00:03:59,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the longer I stay here,</font></font>

72
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:00,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the stronger</font></font>

73
00:04:00,670 --> 00:04:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Wanjun Lock becomes.</font></font>

74
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to get rid of him before it</font></font>

75
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:05,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">completely overpowers me.</font></font>

76
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But Master's soul crystal</font></font>

77
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is about to go completely dormant.</font></font>

78
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm begging you.</font></font>

79
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help me one more time.</font></font>

80
00:04:14,450 --> 00:04:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've already helped you once.</font></font>

81
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your problems matter,</font></font>

82
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but mine don't?</font></font>

83
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:30,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So even if I've forgotten everything</font></font>

84
00:04:30,190 --> 00:04:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from the past 1,000 years,</font></font>

85
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll never forget</font></font>

86
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all the pain and torment she put me through.</font></font>

87
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's nothing more to say to you.</font></font>

88
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll get rid of him now.</font></font>

89
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin!</font></font>

90
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin!</font></font>

91
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin!</font></font>

92
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao?</font></font>

93
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing here?</font></font>

94
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">While the succession trial is underway,</font></font>

95
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'd best avoid any contact.</font></font>

96
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're here to test my abilities,</font></font>

97
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I suggest</font></font>

98
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you leave at once.</font></font>

99
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You think everyone has</font></font>

100
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the same motives as you.</font></font>

101
00:05:34,870 --> 00:05:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With that mindset,</font></font>

102
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how could you lead Mount Zhaowu?</font></font>

103
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong with my attitude?</font></font>

104
00:05:40,510 --> 00:05:41,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At least</font></font>

105
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm honest and direct.</font></font>

106
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You, on the other hand,</font></font>

107
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">pretend to be ascetic and righteous</font></font>

108
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:46,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">while secretly</font></font>

109
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">pining for that girl.</font></font>

110
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing?</font></font>

111
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It doesn't have my name on it.</font></font>

112
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Report me if you like. I'll deny it.</font></font>

113
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Soul Projection</font></font>

114
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can cloud people's minds.</font></font>

115
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It harms others</font></font>

116
00:06:04,950 --> 00:06:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you too.</font></font>

117
00:06:06,830 --> 00:06:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't use it again.</font></font>

118
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You came all this way to accuse me,</font></font>

119
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then destroyed the evidence.</font></font>

120
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What exactly do you want?</font></font>

121
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've made a decision.</font></font>

122
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll let you be the next sect leader.</font></font>

123
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me?</font></font>

124
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The trial hasn't even</font></font>

125
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:33,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">produced a winner yet.</font></font>

126
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean, "let me"?</font></font>

127
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm letting you become sect leader</font></font>

128
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not because you're more suited to it.</font></font>

129
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In fact,</font></font>

130
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with your current temperament and abilities,</font></font>

131
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're not fit for the role.</font></font>

132
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's simply no better candidate.</font></font>

133
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:48,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make do for now,</font></font>

134
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I won't let you do as you please.</font></font>

135
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What nonsense are you spouting?</font></font>

136
00:06:54,270 --> 00:06:55,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You talk as if you've made</font></font>

137
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that Hollow Fruit</font></font>

138
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sprout</font></font>

139
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:59,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and been named sect...</font></font>

140
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could Yuwen Hao</font></font>

141
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">really be giving up on the trial?</font></font>

142
00:07:34,270 --> 00:07:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao?</font></font>

143
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll see for myself</font></font>

144
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how this girl has managed</font></font>

145
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to bewitch Yuwen Hao</font></font>

146
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and whether the two of them</font></font>

147
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have been conspiring to trick me.</font></font>

148
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

149
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know making the mystical flower bloom</font></font>

150
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is all you live for.</font></font>

151
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin?</font></font>

152
00:07:54,470 --> 00:07:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All I'm asking</font></font>

153
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is that you give me two more days.</font></font>

154
00:07:56,860 --> 00:07:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I promise,</font></font>

155
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">even if I have to risk my life,</font></font>

156
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:00,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll help you</font></font>

157
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">reclaim your malice.</font></font>

158
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin is still alive?</font></font>

159
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When did he get here?</font></font>

160
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He already knows</font></font>

161
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who I really am.</font></font>

162
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

163
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The succession assembly is about to begin.</font></font>

164
00:08:25,950 --> 00:08:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you kill me now,</font></font>

165
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you won't be able to stay on Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

166
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master and others from the Five Great Sects</font></font>

167
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will notice I'm missing right away.</font></font>

168
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:35,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They'll investigate</font></font>

169
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and search for me.</font></font>

170
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want to do with him?</font></font>

171
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

172
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not killing him?</font></font>

173
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:45,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He has a point.</font></font>

174
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Killing him now</font></font>

175
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would only cause you trouble.</font></font>

176
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But weren't you about to...?</font></font>

177
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'll wait for me?</font></font>

178
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you really are working</font></font>

179
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:57,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with Qi Fengyin.</font></font>

180
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You pretended to kill him,</font></font>

181
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you've been in league with him</font></font>

182
00:09:01,790 --> 00:09:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and betrayed the immortal sects!</font></font>

183
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about we make a deal?</font></font>

184
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've come to Mount Zhaowu</font></font>

185
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only to save my master's life.</font></font>

186
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once he's saved, I'll leave.</font></font>

187
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can keep you alive.</font></font>

188
00:09:13,390 --> 00:09:14,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if</font></font>

189
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you tell anyone what you saw today,</font></font>

190
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have countless ways</font></font>

191
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to make you wish you were dead.</font></font>

192
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:36,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we're making a deal,</font></font>

193
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what I'm getting</font></font>

194
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hardly compares</font></font>

195
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to what you're getting,</font></font>

196
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">unless you agree to one more thing.</font></font>

197
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Name it.</font></font>

198
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao</font></font>

199
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has given up on the succession trial.</font></font>

200
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's given me</font></font>

201
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his Hollow Bodhi Fruit,</font></font>

202
00:09:51,510 --> 00:09:52,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">which has sprouted.</font></font>

203
00:09:52,510 --> 00:09:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I don't trust him.</font></font>

204
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must make sure</font></font>

205
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he loses to me</font></font>

206
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at the succession assembly.</font></font>

207
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:17,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

208
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:20,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard you'd be stepping aside to let someone else</font></font>

209
00:10:20,410 --> 00:10:21,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">become sect leader.</font></font>

210
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:21,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that true?</font></font>

211
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you being forced into this?</font></font>

212
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't overthink it.</font></font>

213
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just don't want to be sect leader.</font></font>

214
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as no one's forcing you.</font></font>

215
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you don't want to tell me,</font></font>

216
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you must have your reasons.</font></font>

217
00:10:56,910 --> 00:10:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't press you.</font></font>

218
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But Hao,</font></font>

219
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whatever you decide,</font></font>

220
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll support you.</font></font>

221
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said it yourself.</font></font>

222
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whatever I decide.</font></font>

223
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then you can't take it back.</font></font>

224
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry! The assembly is about to start!</font></font>

225
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Candidates</font></font>

226
00:11:37,270 --> 00:11:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for leader of Mount Zhaowu, step forward.</font></font>

227
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:18,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's the rule</font></font>

228
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for choosing Mount Zhaowu's next leader:</font></font>

229
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whoever makes a Hollow Fruit sprout</font></font>

230
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will become Mount Zhaowu's next leader.</font></font>

231
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Both candidates,</font></font>

232
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">please present your Hollow Fruits.</font></font>

233
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let our master,</font></font>

234
00:12:30,750 --> 00:12:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the other sect leaders,</font></font>

235
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and all our fellow disciples</font></font>

236
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">bear witness.</font></font>

237
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's Zhiwei for you!</font></font>

238
00:12:41,750 --> 00:12:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really sprouted!</font></font>

239
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't expect this!</font></font>

240
00:12:45,670 --> 00:12:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's Zhiwei for you!</font></font>

241
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:51,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who'd have thought?</font></font>

242
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The fruit of the Heartless Tree</font></font>

243
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">really can sprout.</font></font>

244
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And to think it wasn't</font></font>

245
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your chief disciple, Yuwen Hao,</font></font>

246
00:12:58,670 --> 00:12:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who did it.</font></font>

247
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao,</font></font>

248
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">where's yours?</font></font>

249
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if you haven't managed it, Hao,</font></font>

250
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's all right.</font></font>

251
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sure no one here</font></font>

252
00:13:16,550 --> 00:13:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would laugh at you.</font></font>

253
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How is that possible?</font></font>

254
00:13:29,630 --> 00:13:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could Hao's fruit not have sprouted?</font></font>

255
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That can't be right.</font></font>

256
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happens now?</font></font>

257
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look!</font></font>

258
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:48,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's Hao for you!</font></font>

259
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao has done it too, as expected.</font></font>

260
00:14:00,390 --> 00:14:01,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

261
00:14:01,550 --> 00:14:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhiwei's is growing a little better.</font></font>

262
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao is our chief disciple, after all.</font></font>

263
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:06,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's no surprise he managed it.</font></font>

264
00:14:07,790 --> 00:14:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Still, judging by their growth,</font></font>

265
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he's lost to me.</font></font>

266
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is tricky.</font></font>

267
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I said</font></font>

268
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:19,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whoever could make a Hollow Fruit sprout</font></font>

269
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:21,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would be Mount Zhaowu's next leader.</font></font>

270
00:14:22,370 --> 00:14:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never said</font></font>

271
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">size would decide the winner.</font></font>

272
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:28,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since you've both succeeded,</font></font>

273
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll declare</font></font>

274
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a tie.</font></font>

275
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

276
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:34,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how can this be a tie?</font></font>

277
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

278
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the tree</font></font>

279
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is called the Heartless Tree.</font></font>

280
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The fruit</font></font>

281
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is called the Hollow Fruit.</font></font>

282
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Both names suggest</font></font>

283
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">something</font></font>

284
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:53,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">close to nothingness,</font></font>

285
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but not nothingness itself.</font></font>

286
00:14:56,550 --> 00:14:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To be heartless is to sever bonds,</font></font>

287
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and to be hollow is to be emptied of all substance.</font></font>

288
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:01,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we reverse that process, we'll see</font></font>

289
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that all things in the world arise from being,</font></font>

290
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:07,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and being arises from nonbeing.</font></font>

291
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:48,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very good.</font></font>

292
00:15:49,750 --> 00:15:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

293
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've attained enlightenment.</font></font>

294
00:16:10,210 --> 00:16:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

295
00:16:11,570 --> 00:16:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have something important to report.</font></font>

296
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wants to expose Qi Fengyin.</font></font>

297
00:16:16,790 --> 00:16:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if I ruin the assembly,</font></font>

298
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:19,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't let him speak.</font></font>

299
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to buy as much time as I can.</font></font>

300
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master...</font></font>

301
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

302
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhiwei has fainted.</font></font>

303
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

304
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhiwei</font></font>

305
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">must have exhausted himself</font></font>

306
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">during the trial.</font></font>

307
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And losing to Hao just now must have</font></font>

308
00:16:40,630 --> 00:16:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">briefly disrupted his circulation.</font></font>

309
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He needs some quiet rest.</font></font>

310
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have him taken away to rest.</font></font>

311
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

312
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The next leader</font></font>

313
00:16:58,270 --> 00:17:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of Mount Zhaowu has been chosen.</font></font>

314
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao,</font></font>

315
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:04,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">step forward.</font></font>

316
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As of today,</font></font>

317
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I</font></font>

318
00:17:21,590 --> 00:17:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will step down as leader of Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

319
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My successor</font></font>

320
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will be Yuwen Hao.</font></font>

321
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations, Master Yuwen.</font></font>

322
00:17:37,070 --> 00:17:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations, Master Yuwen.</font></font>

323
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations, Master Yuwen!</font></font>

324
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you really are working</font></font>

325
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with Qi Fengyin.</font></font>

326
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've been in league with him</font></font>

327
00:18:10,590 --> 00:18:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and betrayed the immortal sects!</font></font>

328
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about we make a deal?</font></font>

329
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Unless you agree to one more thing.</font></font>

330
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So Qi Fengyin is still alive.</font></font>

331
00:18:18,550 --> 00:18:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yamao lied to everyone.</font></font>

332
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:22,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard you'd be stepping aside to let someone else</font></font>

333
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">become sect leader.</font></font>

334
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:24,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that true?</font></font>

335
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whatever you decide,</font></font>

336
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll support you.</font></font>

337
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only as sect leader</font></font>

338
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can I keep you safe.</font></font>

339
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao.</font></font>

340
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations</font></font>

341
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on becoming the next sect leader.</font></font>

342
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I always knew</font></font>

343
00:18:58,550 --> 00:18:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd win the trial.</font></font>

344
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I appreciate that.</font></font>

345
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You seemed so uninterested before.</font></font>

346
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was worried you'd give up.</font></font>

347
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thankfully, at the last moment,</font></font>

348
00:19:09,030 --> 00:19:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you came to your senses.</font></font>

349
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yinhua,</font></font>

350
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have something important to do.</font></font>

351
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's talk</font></font>

352
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about this later.</font></font>

353
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhiwei fainted just now,</font></font>

354
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but from what I saw,</font></font>

355
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">poor circulation wasn't the cause.</font></font>

356
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did something</font></font>

357
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">happen between you two?</font></font>

358
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're overthinking it.</font></font>

359
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was clearly Hao who secretly knocked</font></font>

360
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:40,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhiwei out.</font></font>

361
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did he do that?</font></font>

362
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

363
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what are you hiding?</font></font>

364
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

365
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you really are still alive.</font></font>

366
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't hurt my brother!</font></font>

367
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Miss Duyao,</font></font>

368
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what are you doing here?</font></font>

369
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you know who he is?</font></font>

370
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Duyao,</font></font>

371
00:20:17,590 --> 00:20:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">this doesn't concern you.</font></font>

372
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Step back.</font></font>

373
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wants to kill you,</font></font>

374
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I'll kill him first!</font></font>

375
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Duyao!</font></font>

376
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please put your sword away, Hao.</font></font>

377
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can explain</font></font>

378
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everything to you.</font></font>

379
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What is there to explain?</font></font>

380
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see you're still as crazy as ever.</font></font>

381
00:20:35,790 --> 00:20:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you deceive</font></font>

382
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the immortal sects with Qi Fengyin?</font></font>

383
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you understand the consequences?</font></font>

384
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I hadn't done that,</font></font>

385
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:43,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would any of you have agreed</font></font>

386
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to help me save my master?</font></font>

387
00:20:48,590 --> 00:20:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not too late to put things right.</font></font>

388
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:51,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me kill him.</font></font>

389
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're welcome to try.</font></font>

390
00:20:55,640 --> 00:20:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The one you should be worrying about</font></font>

391
00:20:58,550 --> 00:20:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is your master, Du Zhong.</font></font>

392
00:21:02,030 --> 00:21:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your master is carrying</font></font>

393
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a wisp of my malice.</font></font>

394
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you say?</font></font>

395
00:21:07,350 --> 00:21:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao,</font></font>

396
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you met Xiangyuan.</font></font>

397
00:21:10,790 --> 00:21:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should know</font></font>

398
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">malice attaches itself</font></font>

399
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to those consumed by obsession.</font></font>

400
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we don't remove it in time,</font></font>

401
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Uncle Du could make a terrible mistake.</font></font>

402
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nonsense.</font></font>

403
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You won't fool me again.</font></font>

404
00:21:24,270 --> 00:21:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you don't trust me at all,</font></font>

405
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why did you knock Zhiwei out</font></font>

406
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at the assembly just now</font></font>

407
00:21:30,350 --> 00:21:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to cover for me?</font></font>

408
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My master is a man of integrity.</font></font>

409
00:21:35,750 --> 00:21:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's about to ascend.</font></font>

410
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could he be carrying malice?</font></font>

411
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why not ask him yourself?</font></font>

412
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know it's hard for you to believe.</font></font>

413
00:21:48,070 --> 00:21:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But just wait until he's finished</font></font>

414
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">repairing the talisman.</font></font>

415
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:54,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I'll help you get to the bottom of this.</font></font>

416
00:21:54,830 --> 00:21:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Impossible...</font></font>

417
00:21:56,590 --> 00:21:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't believe Master</font></font>

418
00:21:57,350 --> 00:21:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could be carrying malice.</font></font>

419
00:21:58,920 --> 00:21:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao!</font></font>

420
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll stop him!</font></font>

421
00:22:02,790 --> 00:22:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But he...</font></font>

422
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no point arguing.</font></font>

423
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If he wanted to expose Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

424
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he could've done it</font></font>

425
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at the assembly.</font></font>

426
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:12,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He only came here</font></font>

427
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get some answers.</font></font>

428
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But what do we do</font></font>

429
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if he goes to Du Zhong</font></font>

430
00:22:16,630 --> 00:22:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and confronts him?</font></font>

431
00:22:17,750 --> 00:22:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao is mature and levelheaded.</font></font>

432
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wouldn't do that.</font></font>

433
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry about me.</font></font>

434
00:22:33,030 --> 00:22:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Until you find the talisman,</font></font>

435
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll stay here</font></font>

436
00:22:36,510 --> 00:22:37,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and keep out of sight.</font></font>

437
00:22:37,510 --> 00:22:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I'll stand guard here.</font></font>

438
00:22:38,830 --> 00:22:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If anyone comes...</font></font>

439
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You and Youyou will keep watch here.</font></font>

440
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If anyone comes,</font></font>

441
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">quietly lead them away.</font></font>

442
00:22:43,830 --> 00:22:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't draw attention.</font></font>

443
00:22:44,830 --> 00:22:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Understood?</font></font>

444
00:22:48,550 --> 00:22:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you worried about Yuwen Hao?</font></font>

445
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He owes Du Zhong so much.</font></font>

446
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The truth</font></font>

447
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will be too painful for him to bear.</font></font>

448
00:23:01,030 --> 00:23:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But he'll find out sooner or later.</font></font>

449
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:25,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Miss Yamao,</font></font>

450
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how long have you been here?</font></font>

451
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you been so worried</font></font>

452
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about whether we'll succeed today</font></font>

453
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that you haven't rested at all?</font></font>

454
00:23:33,350 --> 00:23:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

455
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry so much.</font></font>

456
00:23:36,510 --> 00:23:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">High Immortal Danshen will return safely.</font></font>

457
00:23:41,550 --> 00:23:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you both.</font></font>

458
00:24:57,350 --> 00:24:58,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want?</font></font>

459
00:24:58,720 --> 00:24:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did Yuwen Hao send you?</font></font>

460
00:25:00,350 --> 00:25:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't pass out at the assembly</font></font>

461
00:25:02,110 --> 00:25:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from the shock</font></font>

462
00:25:03,590 --> 00:25:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of losing,</font></font>

463
00:25:04,350 --> 00:25:04,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you?</font></font>

464
00:25:09,310 --> 00:25:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one else noticed,</font></font>

465
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I saw</font></font>

466
00:25:13,510 --> 00:25:14,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao</font></font>

467
00:25:15,590 --> 00:25:16,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">secretly cast a spell.</font></font>

468
00:25:21,790 --> 00:25:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've always followed Yuwen Hao</font></font>

469
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">without question.</font></font>

470
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you plotting with him now?</font></font>

471
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you trying to pull this time?</font></font>

472
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hao is kind and honest.</font></font>

473
00:25:32,270 --> 00:25:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's easily taken advantage of.</font></font>

474
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not here</font></font>

475
00:25:36,550 --> 00:25:38,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get you out of trouble.</font></font>

476
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here to save him.</font></font>

477
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What exactly happened between you two?</font></font>

478
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At the assembly,</font></font>

479
00:25:48,340 --> 00:25:49,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why did he knock you out?</font></font>

480
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao</font></font>

481
00:25:52,070 --> 00:25:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is shielding Yamao, a traitor to the immortal sects.</font></font>

482
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's conspiring with her</font></font>

483
00:25:56,440 --> 00:25:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to deceive everyone in the Five Great Sects.</font></font>

484
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's harboring</font></font>

485
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the devil Qi Fengyin here on Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

486
00:26:06,350 --> 00:26:08,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that what you call</font></font>

487
00:26:08,350 --> 00:26:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">being kind and honest?</font></font>

488
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:18,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How much longer do we have to stay</font></font>

489
00:26:18,450 --> 00:26:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on Mount Zhaowu?</font></font>

490
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This place is so dull.</font></font>

491
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't stand another moment here.</font></font>

492
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's nothing good to eat</font></font>

493
00:26:24,470 --> 00:26:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and nothing fun to do.</font></font>

494
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We have to hide and sneak around every day,</font></font>

495
00:26:27,750 --> 00:26:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">always on edge.</font></font>

496
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:30,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By the end of today,</font></font>

497
00:26:31,110 --> 00:26:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everything</font></font>

498
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">should be settled.</font></font>

499
00:26:34,650 --> 00:26:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, right.</font></font>

500
00:26:35,510 --> 00:26:36,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hear the immortal sects</font></font>

501
00:26:36,870 --> 00:26:38,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hunt rare beasts and gather mystical plants</font></font>

502
00:26:38,870 --> 00:26:39,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for their meals.</font></font>

503
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Eating them boosts your cultivation.</font></font>

504
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See if you can find</font></font>

505
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">anything good to eat.</font></font>

506
00:26:42,830 --> 00:26:43,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as His Lordship didn't cook it,</font></font>

507
00:26:43,780 --> 00:26:44,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">anything's fine.</font></font>

508
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right.</font></font>

509
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Duyao!</font></font>

510
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you eat?</font></font>

511
00:27:20,880 --> 00:27:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

512
00:27:25,590 --> 00:27:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, wake up!</font></font>

513
00:27:31,270 --> 00:27:32,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good. She's still alive.</font></font>

514
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord.</font></font>

515
00:27:35,310 --> 00:27:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened?</font></font>

516
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I asked her</font></font>

517
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to help me find</font></font>

518
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">food that would boost my cultivation.</font></font>

519
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She had one mouthful of this porridge</font></font>

520
00:27:42,310 --> 00:27:43,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and passed out.</font></font>

521
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I'd known,</font></font>

522
00:27:44,720 --> 00:27:46,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't have thought of eating their food.</font></font>

523
00:27:47,350 --> 00:27:48,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is Soul-Soothing Porridge.</font></font>

524
00:27:48,790 --> 00:27:49,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeniang made it</font></font>

525
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">especially for Du Zhong.</font></font>

526
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why did she</font></font>

527
00:27:52,550 --> 00:27:54,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">drug Du Zhong's porridge?</font></font>

528
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I may have</font></font>

529
00:27:56,130 --> 00:27:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">missed something.</font></font>

530
00:27:58,310 --> 00:27:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stay here</font></font>

531
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and watch over Duyao.</font></font>

532
00:28:00,590 --> 00:28:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait, My Lord.</font></font>

533
00:28:01,590 --> 00:28:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuwen Hao has broken your disguise spell.</font></font>

534
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you go now,</font></font>

535
00:28:04,490 --> 00:28:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll be in danger.</font></font>

536
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to find Yeniang.</font></font>

537
00:28:19,960 --> 00:28:21,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're Qi from the kitchen.</font></font>

538
00:28:22,350 --> 00:28:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's in your basket?</font></font>

539
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just medicinal porridge for Master Du.</font></font>

540
00:28:33,030 --> 00:28:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...!</font></font>

541
00:28:39,550 --> 00:28:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No wonder you always return</font></font>

542
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to Qingjing Grove</font></font>

543
00:28:42,440 --> 00:28:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">after delivering Du Zhong's Soul-Soothing Porridge.</font></font>

544
00:28:44,400 --> 00:28:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've been stealing</font></font>

545
00:28:45,350 --> 00:28:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">these petals formed from his obsession.</font></font>

546
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:48,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've known for some time</font></font>

547
00:28:49,110 --> 00:28:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that you're no ordinary kitchen helper.</font></font>

548
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've kept quiet</font></font>

549
00:28:53,110 --> 00:28:54,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about everything you've done.</font></font>

550
00:28:55,110 --> 00:28:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't we do each other a favor?</font></font>

551
00:29:03,350 --> 00:29:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You return to Qingjing Grove</font></font>

552
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">after Du Zhong falls asleep.</font></font>

553
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:07,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one opens the barrier for you,</font></font>

554
00:29:08,590 --> 00:29:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you can't use immortal techniques.</font></font>

555
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you get in?</font></font>

556
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As far as I know,</font></font>

557
00:29:13,350 --> 00:29:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qingjing Grove was</font></font>

558
00:29:14,730 --> 00:29:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hua Changpu's only home.</font></font>

559
00:29:16,070 --> 00:29:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one but Du Zhong</font></font>

560
00:29:16,980 --> 00:29:18,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could come and go there freely.</font></font>

561
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then Yan Shang</font></font>

562
00:29:20,050 --> 00:29:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">broke Hua Changpu's legs</font></font>

563
00:29:22,310 --> 00:29:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and disfigured half her face.</font></font>

564
00:29:24,310 --> 00:29:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're scarred on that very same side.</font></font>

565
00:29:28,750 --> 00:29:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're Yeniang,</font></font>

566
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you're also Hua Changpu.</font></font>

567
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:41,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never imagined</font></font>

568
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that even in this state,</font></font>

569
00:29:46,070 --> 00:29:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">someone would still recognize me</font></font>

570
00:29:48,480 --> 00:29:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as Hua Changpu.</font></font>

571
00:29:50,750 --> 00:29:51,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really are Hua Changpu.</font></font>

572
00:29:54,030 --> 00:29:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A hundred years ago, Du Zhong</font></font>

573
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">failed to kill me</font></font>

574
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but left me living like a ghost.</font></font>

575
00:29:59,750 --> 00:30:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I don't destroy him,</font></font>

576
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how can I live with myself?</font></font>

577
00:30:04,270 --> 00:30:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But Yan Shang was the one who tried to kill you.</font></font>

578
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you believe it was Yan Shang too?</font></font>

579
00:30:10,550 --> 00:30:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ah, Du Zhong.</font></font>

580
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So noble, so saintly.</font></font>

581
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone else is to blame:</font></font>

582
00:30:16,030 --> 00:30:17,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yan Shang, for protecting</font></font>

583
00:30:17,110 --> 00:30:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the sect's good name,</font></font>

584
00:30:19,110 --> 00:30:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and me, for loving Du Zhong.</font></font>

585
00:30:21,830 --> 00:30:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But what about him?</font></font>

586
00:30:23,480 --> 00:30:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Has he really done</font></font>

587
00:30:24,660 --> 00:30:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">nothing wrong?</font></font>

588
00:30:35,070 --> 00:30:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aside from immortality,</font></font>

589
00:30:37,270 --> 00:30:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't there</font></font>

590
00:30:38,110 --> 00:30:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">anything else that matters to you?</font></font>

591
00:30:40,510 --> 00:30:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My mind is made up.</font></font>

592
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You spend all day</font></font>

593
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">catching birds and fish.</font></font>

594
00:31:15,830 --> 00:31:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When will you make progress in your studies?</font></font>

595
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

596
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could you stop following the Path of Detachment?</font></font>

597
00:32:15,510 --> 00:32:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

598
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there's no place on Mount Zhaowu</font></font>

599
00:32:17,860 --> 00:32:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for a woman like Hua Changpu.</font></font>

600
00:32:19,340 --> 00:32:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You follow the Path of Detachment.</font></font>

601
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When passion stirs,</font></font>

602
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're in unbearable pain.</font></font>

603
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Others may not see it,</font></font>

604
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I've followed you the longest.</font></font>

605
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I not notice?</font></font>

606
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My affairs</font></font>

607
00:32:30,750 --> 00:32:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are no one else's concern.</font></font>

608
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave.</font></font>

609
00:32:33,790 --> 00:32:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master, would you really give up</font></font>

610
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Path of Detachment for her?</font></font>

611
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've devoted my life to cultivation.</font></font>

612
00:32:44,510 --> 00:32:46,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just one step from ascending to immortality.</font></font>

613
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would I give it up for anyone?</font></font>

614
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But Hua Changpu does all she can to bewitch you.</font></font>

615
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you afraid she'll ruin</font></font>

616
00:32:53,110 --> 00:32:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your lifetime of cultivation?</font></font>

617
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why not expel her from the sect?</font></font>

618
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since she wants love,</font></font>

619
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">let her marry</font></font>

620
00:33:14,530 --> 00:33:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">another man.</font></font>

621
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Impossible!</font></font>

622
00:33:20,310 --> 00:33:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Expel her from the sect</font></font>

623
00:33:22,070 --> 00:33:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and let her marry</font></font>

624
00:33:23,350 --> 00:33:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">another man?</font></font>

625
00:33:24,240 --> 00:33:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Absolutely not!</font></font>

626
00:33:29,590 --> 00:33:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In life and in death,</font></font>

627
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she belongs to Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

628
00:33:33,310 --> 00:33:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether at the ends of the world,</font></font>

629
00:33:34,490 --> 00:33:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the heavens, or the underworld,</font></font>

630
00:33:35,550 --> 00:33:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she will always be my disciple!</font></font>

631
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master,</font></font>

632
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you...</font></font>

633
00:34:09,190 --> 00:34:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please let me rid you</font></font>

634
00:34:12,190 --> 00:34:14,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of the source of your inner demons.</font></font>

635
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:32,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Inner demons...</font></font>

636
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Path of Detachment</font></font>

637
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">meant he couldn't love me.</font></font>

638
00:35:28,070 --> 00:35:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His own selfishness</font></font>

639
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:31,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">meant he wouldn't let me go.</font></font>

640
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:33,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only my death</font></font>

641
00:35:34,150 --> 00:35:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could wipe it all away.</font></font>

642
00:35:37,150 --> 00:35:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I crawled back</font></font>

643
00:35:38,320 --> 00:35:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from the foot of that towering cliff.</font></font>

644
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:43,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I let him get his wish?</font></font>

645
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Soul-Soothing Porridge</font></font>

646
00:35:49,040 --> 00:35:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you make with these petals</font></font>

647
00:35:51,190 --> 00:35:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">seems to free Du Zhong from his inner demons,</font></font>

648
00:35:54,760 --> 00:35:56,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but it actually makes them</font></font>

649
00:35:56,370 --> 00:35:57,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">take even deeper root.</font></font>

650
00:35:58,960 --> 00:35:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

651
00:36:01,030 --> 00:36:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My face was ruined,</font></font>

652
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and my powers destroyed.</font></font>

653
00:36:04,670 --> 00:36:05,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've survived all these years as a wretched shell</font></font>

654
00:36:05,970 --> 00:36:07,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of my former self.</font></font>

655
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:09,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm out to destroy his faith in the immortal path</font></font>

656
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and his cultivation,</font></font>

657
00:36:11,090 --> 00:36:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what he treasures most.</font></font>

658
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:15,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of you can stop me.</font></font>

659
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin is up ahead!</font></font>

660
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't let him escape again!</font></font>

661
00:36:24,550 --> 00:36:26,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your own life is in danger.</font></font>

662
00:36:26,630 --> 00:36:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stay out of other people's affairs.</font></font>

663
00:36:48,070 --> 00:36:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou!</font></font>

664
00:36:49,630 --> 00:36:50,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qingxing?</font></font>

665
00:36:53,230 --> 00:36:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did you know we were here?</font></font>

666
00:36:54,670 --> 00:36:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All of Mount Zhaowu knows now</font></font>

667
00:36:56,030 --> 00:36:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that Qi Fengyin is still alive.</font></font>

668
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhiwei has called on the disciples</font></font>

669
00:36:58,190 --> 00:36:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to hunt him down.</font></font>

670
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:00,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave now, while you still can,</font></font>

671
00:37:00,630 --> 00:37:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or you won't get away.</font></font>

672
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qingxing,</font></font>

673
00:37:05,590 --> 00:37:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Lordship has no powers now.</font></font>

674
00:37:07,030 --> 00:37:08,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If they capture him,</font></font>

675
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he's finished.</font></font>

676
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I swear His Lordship</font></font>

677
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">means Mount Zhaowu no harm.</font></font>

678
00:37:12,510 --> 00:37:13,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He only wants to reclaim</font></font>

679
00:37:13,850 --> 00:37:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his malice from Du Zhong.</font></font>

680
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help me save His Lordship.</font></font>

681
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please?</font></font>

682
00:37:18,920 --> 00:37:19,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm begging you!</font></font>

683
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't help you.</font></font>

684
00:37:24,190 --> 00:37:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I can't trust you.</font></font>

685
00:37:25,880 --> 00:37:26,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you leave now,</font></font>

686
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can still get away alive.</font></font>

687
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise,</font></font>

688
00:37:29,190 --> 00:37:30,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll have to obey Master's orders</font></font>

689
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and capture you as his accomplice.</font></font>

690
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:33,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Youyou,</font></font>

691
00:37:34,190 --> 00:37:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">think twice.</font></font>

692
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:37,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qing...</font></font>

693
00:37:38,630 --> 00:37:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do I do now?</font></font>

694
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He has the Wanjun Lock on him.</font></font>

695
00:37:48,480 --> 00:37:49,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After all this time on Mount Zhaowu,</font></font>

696
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his movements must be tightly restricted.</font></font>

697
00:37:52,190 --> 00:37:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be afraid of him.</font></font>

698
00:37:53,030 --> 00:37:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Attack!</font></font>

699
00:38:04,480 --> 00:38:05,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fellow disciples,</font></font>

700
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if we slay Qi Fengyin today,</font></font>

701
00:38:07,630 --> 00:38:08,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll be famous throughout the world.</font></font>

702
00:38:09,030 --> 00:38:10,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone, follow my orders.</font></font>

703
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Strike from afar with sword energy!</font></font>

704
00:38:11,670 --> 00:38:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Form the sword hand seal!</font></font>

705
00:38:47,510 --> 00:38:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master!</font></font>

706
00:38:50,880 --> 00:38:51,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bad news!</font></font>

707
00:38:52,070 --> 00:38:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin is still alive.</font></font>

708
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's hiding here on Mount Zhaowu.</font></font>

709
00:39:00,400 --> 00:39:00,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yinhua,</font></font>

710
00:39:01,190 --> 00:39:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is that true?</font></font>

711
00:39:02,230 --> 00:39:03,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you sure it's Qi Fengyin?</font></font>

712
00:39:07,760 --> 00:39:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

713
00:39:20,840 --> 00:39:22,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I... I don't know.</font></font>

714
00:39:24,710 --> 00:39:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Esteemed sect leaders,</font></font>

715
00:39:25,590 --> 00:39:26,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">let's go and see for ourselves</font></font>

716
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether it's true.</font></font>

717
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

718
00:39:35,000 --> 00:39:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to save your master,</font></font>

719
00:39:36,280 --> 00:39:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stay out of this.</font></font>

720
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord.</font></font>

721
00:39:50,110 --> 00:39:50,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord...</font></font>

722
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:52,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you hurt?</font></font>

723
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They'll catch up with us soon.</font></font>

724
00:39:54,320 --> 00:39:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forget the malice for now.</font></font>

725
00:39:56,550 --> 00:39:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Run.</font></font>

726
00:40:09,920 --> 00:40:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It really is Qi Fengyin.</font></font>

727
00:40:13,670 --> 00:40:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where can you run now?</font></font>

728
00:40:26,150 --> 00:40:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since Qi Fengyin is still alive,</font></font>

729
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what was all that talk</font></font>

730
00:40:29,120 --> 00:40:29,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about Miss Yamao</font></font>

731
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">slaying the devil?</font></font>

732
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Clearly, Yamao</font></font>

733
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has been conspiring with Qi Fengyin</font></font>

734
00:40:39,070 --> 00:40:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to deceive us all.</font></font>

735
00:40:46,190 --> 00:40:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If they find out</font></font>

736
00:40:47,190 --> 00:40:48,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've been working with Qi Fengyin,</font></font>

737
00:40:49,190 --> 00:40:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our efforts will all go to waste,</font></font>

738
00:40:50,920 --> 00:40:51,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I'll be...</font></font>

739
00:40:52,320 --> 00:40:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're all so ridiculous.</font></font>

740
00:40:57,550 --> 00:40:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You actually thought</font></font>

741
00:40:58,440 --> 00:40:59,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a mere herb spirit</font></font>

742
00:41:00,150 --> 00:41:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">could kill me so easily?</font></font>

743
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was simply tired</font></font>

744
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of being chased,</font></font>

745
00:41:07,360 --> 00:41:09,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I used her to fake my death.</font></font>

746
00:41:11,030 --> 00:41:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin...</font></font>

747
00:41:14,150 --> 00:41:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fooling an herb spirit is one thing.</font></font>

748
00:41:16,150 --> 00:41:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I never thought</font></font>

749
00:41:17,030 --> 00:41:18,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the mighty Five Great Sects</font></font>

750
00:41:19,510 --> 00:41:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would fall for it so easily</font></font>

751
00:41:22,960 --> 00:41:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and let me toy with you.</font></font>

752
00:41:25,800 --> 00:41:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What a joke.</font></font>

753
00:41:27,630 --> 00:41:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You fiend.</font></font>

754
00:41:29,070 --> 00:41:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you boast when you're about to die?</font></font>

755
00:41:31,710 --> 00:41:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's bound by the Wanjun Lock now.</font></font>

756
00:41:34,880 --> 00:41:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We mustn't let this fiend escape today!</font></font>

757
00:41:58,960 --> 00:41:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bind his hands!</font></font>

758
00:42:09,510 --> 00:42:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin has denied</font></font>

759
00:42:10,630 --> 00:42:11,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're working together.</font></font>

760
00:42:12,070 --> 00:42:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I just hold back now,</font></font>

761
00:42:13,630 --> 00:42:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everything can go back to the way it was.</font></font>

762
00:42:18,670 --> 00:42:19,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Master will wake up,</font></font>

763
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll still be part of the immortal sects,</font></font>

764
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I can return to Luoshen Valley.</font></font>

765
00:42:34,960 --> 00:42:36,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll just die again. So what?</font></font>

766
00:42:48,510 --> 00:42:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you hurt anywhere?</font></font>

767
00:42:58,840 --> 00:42:59,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't touch my blood.</font></font>

768
00:43:00,030 --> 00:43:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry about me.</font></font>

769
00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Worry about yourself.</font></font>

770
00:43:05,360 --> 00:43:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can have it back.</font></font>

771
00:43:09,120 --> 00:43:10,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not afraid of losing you.</font></font>

772
00:43:13,230 --> 00:43:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

773
00:43:14,840 --> 00:43:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wherever you go,</font></font>

774
00:43:17,000 --> 00:43:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can always find you.</font></font>

775
00:43:21,710 --> 00:43:23,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've been thinking about the past few days.</font></font>

776
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I think</font></font>

777
00:43:26,150 --> 00:43:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're not the bloodthirsty monster</font></font>

778
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:28,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everyone claims.</font></font>

779
00:43:33,060 --> 00:43:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Be good]</font></font>

780
00:43:50,320 --> 00:43:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin!</font></font>

781
00:43:53,380 --> 00:43:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪</font></font>

782
00:44:00,060 --> 00:44:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪</font></font>

783
00:44:07,300 --> 00:44:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One thought binds cause and effect, who can tell right from wrong?♪</font></font>

784
00:44:11,340 --> 00:44:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Threads of love entwine the stars♪</font></font>

785
00:44:14,220 --> 00:44:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪</font></font>

786
00:44:21,460 --> 00:44:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪In this fleeting, complex world, good and evil♪</font></font>

787
00:44:23,540 --> 00:44:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Blur together, ensnaring you and me♪</font></font>

788
00:44:28,340 --> 00:44:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world...♪</font></font>

789
00:44:34,480 --> 00:44:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yinhua was right.</font></font>

790
00:44:37,630 --> 00:44:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Fengyin and I</font></font>

791
00:44:38,760 --> 00:44:40,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">planned all of this together.</font></font>

792
00:44:43,110 --> 00:44:44,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll never let any of you</font></font>

793
00:44:45,070 --> 00:44:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hurt Qi Fengyin.</font></font>

794
00:45:00,110 --> 00:45:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can fix</font></font>

795
00:45:01,150 --> 00:45:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that little flaw too.</font></font>

796
00:45:02,480 --> 00:45:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

797
00:45:03,070 --> 00:45:04,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just now, were you worried</font></font>

798
00:45:04,360 --> 00:45:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about the mystical flower</font></font>

799
00:45:06,230 --> 00:45:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or about me?</font></font>

800
00:45:10,760 --> 00:45:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord, wake up!</font></font>

801
00:45:12,550 --> 00:45:13,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's Yamao!</font></font>

802
00:45:14,190 --> 00:45:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's the woman you love most!</font></font>

803
00:45:38,900 --> 00:45:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪</font></font>

804
00:45:43,180 --> 00:45:46,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪So many longings♪</font></font>

805
00:45:47,300 --> 00:45:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Linger in the web of fate♪</font></font>

806
00:45:49,580 --> 00:45:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪</font></font>

807
00:45:55,500 --> 00:45:59,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Before seas turn to fields♪</font></font>

808
00:45:59,780 --> 00:46:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪</font></font>

809
00:46:03,900 --> 00:46:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One look into each other's eyes♪</font></font>

810
00:46:06,180 --> 00:46:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And we fall in love in an instant♪</font></font>

811
00:46:14,980 --> 00:46:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪</font></font>

812
00:46:18,900 --> 00:46:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪</font></font>

813
00:46:23,220 --> 00:46:26,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The wish we made in the long night♪</font></font>

814
00:46:27,100 --> 00:46:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Still waits to come true♪</font></font>

815
00:46:31,500 --> 00:46:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪</font></font>

816
00:46:35,740 --> 00:46:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll stay by your side♪</font></font>

817
00:46:39,860 --> 00:46:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪</font></font>

818
00:46:43,700 --> 00:46:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪</font></font>

819
00:47:04,500 --> 00:47:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Before seas turn to fields♪</font></font>

820
00:47:08,780 --> 00:47:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪</font></font>

821
00:47:12,900 --> 00:47:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One look into each other's eyes♪</font></font>

822
00:47:15,140 --> 00:47:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And we fall in love in an instant♪</font></font>

823
00:47:23,500 --> 00:47:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪</font></font>

824
00:47:27,780 --> 00:47:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll stay by your side♪</font></font>

825
00:47:31,900 --> 00:47:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪</font></font>

826
00:47:35,700 --> 00:47:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪</font></font>
